ll in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"lizper-feet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1f1604dc88f4e382bd7e.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b79092ee4a292010c666.svg\" alt=\"\">Lizper Scale</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/32c045dadd9ca37ea76c.svg\" alt=\"Lizper Feet\"></div><h3>Lizper Feet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 46</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>9 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/25/2026, 2:29:58 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}